| Claude Fable 5.1      | 128K              | —                    |
| Claude Mythos 5.1     | 128K              | —                    |
| Claude Fable 5        | 128K              | —                    |
| Claude Mythos 5       | 128K              | —                    |
| Claude Mythos Preview | 128K              | Not available        |
| Claude Opus 5.5       | 128K              | 300K                 |
